AS shown in index/FAISS runbooks.

AI_FEATURE_HUB.PROC_RETIRE_INDEX_SNAPSHOT_SAFE — Purpose: mark snapshot RETIRE_REQUESTED AND CREATE retirement audit without deleting external objects.

